<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Torre de Controle — Reabastecimento Logás</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/xlsx/0.18.5/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.css">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.js"></script>
<script src="dados.js"></script>
<script src="viagem.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#070b14; --bg2:#0a1120; --panel:#0f1828; --panel2:#13203a; --line:#22324d;
    --text:#eef4fd; --muted:#8298b9; --cyan:#3bc4ec;
    --green:#2bd18a; --yellow:#f4cb53; --orange:#f59140; --red:#f1556a;
    --shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{height:100%;margin:0}
  body{background:radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 70% -10%,#0d1730,var(--bg));
       color:var(--text);font-family:"Segoe UI",system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;
       display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100vh;overflow:hidden}

  header{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;
         padding:8px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
         background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,32,58,.6),transparent);flex:0 0 auto}
  .hspacer{display:none}
  .brand{flex:1 1 auto;text-align:center;min-width:0}
  .brand .ttl{font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,24px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.6px;white-space:nowrap}
  .brand .ttl span{color:var(--cyan)}
  .brand .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:3px}
  .right{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:16px}
  .kpi{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
       padding:8px 18px;text-align:center;min-width:88px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .kpi b{display:block;font-size:26px;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .kpi small{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
  .clock{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:1px}
  .gear{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);border-radius:12px;
        width:46px;height:46px;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer}
  .gear:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan)}

  main{flex:1 1 auto;display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;overflow:hidden}
  #grid{flex:1 1 auto;display:flex;gap:12px;min-width:0;overflow:hidden}
  .col{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-width:0}
  .rrow{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:stretch;flex:1 1 0;min-height:0}
  .rrow .region{flex:1;min-width:0}
  .region{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg2));border:1px solid var(--line);
          border-radius:12px;padding:9px 11px 11px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
          display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0}
  .region h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;
             letter-spacing:1.2px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex:0 0 auto}
  .region h2::before{content:"";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--cyan)}
  .region .cnt{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.5px}
  /* Cada região usa colunas iguais (definidas em buildGrid): 4 em região cheia, 2 em
     região pareada de meia coluna. Assim os cards têm ~a mesma largura em todo o quadro.
     minmax(0,1fr) impede que o conteúdo empurre o card para fora da caixa. */
  .cells{display:grid;gap:8px;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));
         flex:1 1 auto;align-content:start}
  h2.hidden{visibility:hidden}
  .cell .ssdot{position:absolute;top:7px;right:9px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;opacity:.75}
  .cell.ss{opacity:.92}

  .cell{position:relative;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel2),var(--bg2));
        border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--green);
        padding:9px 10px 10px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s,border-color .12s,box-shadow .12s;
        min-width:0;min-height:96px;overflow:hidden}
  .cell:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);border-color:var(--cyan)}
  .cell .nm{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.3px;color:#dbe6f6;
            white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;margin-bottom:4px}
  .cell .pr{font-size:21px;font-weight:800;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.1;
            white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .cell .pr small{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;margin-left:2px}
  .cell .rate{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .cell .foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:6px;min-height:18px}
  .cell .hr{font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
  .pill{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.6px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:20px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .cell .arrow{position:absolute;top:10px;right:11px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .12s}
  .cell:hover .arrow{opacity:1}
  .cell.crit{border-top-color:var(--red);animation:pulse 1.5s infinite}
  .cell.urg{border-top-color:var(--orange)}
  .cell.warn{border-top-color:var(--yellow)}
  .cell.off{border-top-color:var(--muted);opacity:.6;cursor:default}
  .cell.off:hover{transform:none;border-color:var(--line);box-shadow:none}
  .cell.off .pr{font-size:16px;color:var(--red);font-style:italic}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 rgba(241,85,106,0)}50%{box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(241,85,106,.55)}}

  /* ---------- Painel lateral de alertas ---------- */
  #alertPanel{flex:0 0 332px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;
              padding:6px 6px 6px 18px;margin-left:6px;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
  .apHead{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text);
          display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:0 2px 8px;margin-bottom:1px;flex:0 0 auto;
          border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .apHead::before{content:"";width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--cyan)}
  .apSec{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg2));border:1px solid var(--line);
         border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);flex:0 0 auto}
  .apSecHead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;
             letter-spacing:.9px;margin-bottom:11px}
  .apSecHead .num{margin-left:auto;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:13px;background:var(--bg2);
                  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:2px 11px;color:var(--text)}
  .apSecHead.crit{color:var(--red)} .apSecHead.urg{color:var(--orange)} .apSecHead.ss{color:var(--muted)}
  .alert-item{position:relative;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:9px;cursor:pointer;
              background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--muted);
              transition:transform .1s,border-color .1s,box-shadow .1s}
  .alert-item:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
  .alert-item:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);transform:translateX(-3px);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
  .alert-item.crit{border-left-color:var(--red);animation:pulse 1.5s infinite}
  .alert-item.urg{border-left-color:var(--orange)}
  .alert-item.ss{border-left-color:var(--muted)}
  .ai-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}
  .ai-nm{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#dbe6f6;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .ai-reg{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto}
  .ai-bot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:7px}
  .ai-pr{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .ai-pr small{font-size:10px}
  .ai-sub{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.35}
  .ai-empty{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;font-style:italic;padding:4px 2px}
  #alertPanel .pill{white-space:nowrap}
  #alertPanel::-webkit-scrollbar{width:8px}
  #alertPanel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);border-radius:6px}

  .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(3,6,12,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);
           display:none;z-index:20;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}
  .overlay.open{display:flex}
  .detail{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg2));border:1px solid var(--line);
          border-radius:18px;width:min(920px,94vw);max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .detail .dh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;padding:11px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .detail .dh h3{margin:0;font-size:20px}
  .detail .dh .reg{color:var(--cyan);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:4px}
  .close{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);border-radius:8px;width:36px;height:36px;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer}
  .close:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}
  .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(128px,1fr));gap:7px;padding:9px 24px}
  .stat{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:7px 11px}
  .stat b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .stat small{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;line-height:1.15;display:block}
  .chartwrap{padding:2px 24px 4px}
  .chartwrap h4{margin:0 0 2px;font-size:13px;color:#cfe0f5}
  .chartwrap .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin:0 0 12px}
  .chartbox{position:relative;height:190px}
  .addread{margin:6px 24px 0;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel2)}
  .addread .arttl{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:6px}
  .addread .arttl span{text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--cyan)}
  .addread .arrow2{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .addread input{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 11px;width:150px;font-size:15px}
  .addread .armsg{font-size:12px;color:var(--green)}
  .dactions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;padding:9px 24px 14px}

  .cfgbox{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;width:min(900px,94vw);max-height:88vh;overflow:auto;padding:22px 24px}
  .cfgbox h3{margin:0 0 4px}
  .cfgbox p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 16px}
  .cfgrow{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}
  .cfgrow label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .cfgrow input{margin-top:5px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);border-radius:7px;padding:7px 9px;width:130px}
  .cfgrow input[type=date]{cursor:pointer}
  .cfgrow input[type=date]:hover{border-color:var(--cyan)}
  input[type=date]::-webkit-calendar-picker-indicator{filter:invert(.85) sepia(1) saturate(3) hue-rotate(160deg);cursor:pointer;opacity:.95;font-size:16px}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
  th,td{padding:6px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}
  th{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase}
  td input{width:82px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 7px;text-align:right}
  .btn{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 16px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}
  .btn:hover{border-color:var(--cyan)}
  .btn.primary{background:var(--cyan);color:#04121b;border-color:var(--cyan);font-weight:700}
  .btnrow{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:16px}
  main::-webkit-scrollbar,.detail::-webkit-scrollbar,.cfgbox::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px}
  main::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);border-radius:6px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="hspacer"></div>
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="ttl">CENTRO DE OPERAÇÕES — <span>LOGÁS</span> · REABASTECIMENTO</div>
    <div class="sub" id="sub">Carregando leituras…</div>
  </div>
  <div class="right">
    <div class="kpi"><b style="color:var(--red)" id="kCrit">0</b><small>Crítico</small></div>
    <div class="kpi"><b style="color:var(--orange)" id="kUrg">0</b><small>Urgente</small></div>
    <div class="kpi" id="kSemSinalBox"><b style="color:var(--muted)" id="kSemSinal">0</b><small>Sem Sinal</small></div>
    <div class="kpi" id="kDispBox" style="cursor:pointer" title="Plano de despacho (todas as bases) — clique para abrir"><b style="color:var(--cyan)" id="kDisp">–</b><small>Despacho</small></div>
    <div class="clock" id="clock">--:--:--</div>
    <button class="gear" id="btnExport" title="Exportar relatório (CSV/Excel) — resumo + dados brutos">⬇</button>
    <button class="gear" id="gear" title="Configurar limites e parâmetros">⚙</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div id="grid"></div>
  <aside id="alertPanel">
    <div class="apHead">Eventos ativos</div>
    <div class="apSec">
      <div class="apSecHead crit">🔴 Crítico<span class="num" id="apCritN">0</span></div>
      <div id="apCrit"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="apSec">
      <div class="apSecHead urg">🟠 Urgente<span class="num" id="apUrgN">0</span></div>
      <div id="apUrg"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="apSec">
      <div class="apSecHead ss">⚪ Sem Sinal<span class="num" id="apSsN">0</span></div>
      <div id="apSs"></div>
    </div>
  </aside>
</main>

<!-- Detalhe -->
<div class="overlay" id="detailOverlay">
  <div class="detail">
    <div class="dh">
      <div><h3 id="dName">—</h3><div class="reg" id="dReg">—</div></div>
      <button class="close" id="dClose">✕</button>
    </div>
    <div id="dOffline" style="display:none;margin:0 24px;margin-top:16px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;
         background:rgba(241,85,106,.14);border:1px solid var(--red);color:#ffd0d6;font-size:13px;font-weight:600"></div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><b id="sPrev">—</b><small id="sPrevL">Leitura anterior</small></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="sP">—</b><small id="sPL">Pressão atual (Bar)</small></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="sLast">—</b><small>Consumo na última hora</small></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="sRate">—</b><small>Consumo médio (Bar/h)</small></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="sMin">—</b><small>Limite crítico (Bar)</small></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="sH">—</b><small>Horas até o limite</small></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="sBase">—</b><small>Base de abastecimento</small></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="sViagem">—</b><small>Tempo de viagem (h)</small></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="sSaida">—</b><small>Sair da base até</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chartwrap">
      <h4>Histórico de pressão</h4>
      <p class="note" id="dNote"></p>
      <div class="chartbox"><canvas id="chart"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="addread">
      <div class="arttl">Registrar leitura manual <span id="dNowHint"></span></div>
      <div class="arrow2">
        <input id="dNewVal" type="number" step="0.01" placeholder="Pressão (Bar)">
        <button class="btn primary" id="dAddBtn">Registrar</button>
        <button class="btn" id="dNoSig">Sem sinal</button>
        <button class="btn" id="dUndo" title="Desfazer a última leitura manual desta empresa">Desfazer manual</button>
        <span id="dAddMsg" class="armsg"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="addread" id="corrBox" style="border-color:var(--orange)">
      <div class="arttl">Corrigir leitura <span>(corrige o valor de qualquer leitura — automática ou manual)</span></div>
      <div class="arrow2">
        <select id="dCorrSel" style="background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:14px;max-width:240px"></select>
        <input id="dCorrVal" type="number" step="0.01" placeholder="Valor correto (Bar)">
        <button class="btn primary" id="dCorrBtn">Salvar correção</button>
        <button class="btn" id="dCorrUndo" title="Restaurar o valor original (apenas leitura automática)">Remover correção</button>
        <span id="dCorrMsg" class="armsg"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dactions">
      <button class="btn" id="dRota" style="display:none">Ver rota</button>
      <button class="btn" id="dEdit">Editar limite</button>
      <button class="btn primary" id="dClose2">Fechar</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Config -->
<div class="overlay" id="cfgOverlay">
  <div class="cfgbox">
    <h3>Configuração</h3>
    <p>O consumo é calculado automaticamente pela diferença entre as fotos. Aqui você define, por empresa, o limite crítico, a base de abastecimento e o tempo de viagem da base até a empresa. O sistema calcula o horário-limite para o caminhão sair da base e chegar antes de faltar gás.</p>
    <div class="cfgrow">
      <label>Preparação/carregamento na base (h)<input type="number" id="buffer" value="0" min="0" step="0.5"></label>
      <label>Consumo provisório (Bar/h)<input type="number" id="fallback" value="20" min="1" step="1"></label>
      <button class="btn" id="resetBtn">Restaurar limites padrão</button>
    </div>
    <table id="cfgTable"><tbody></tbody></table>
    <div class="btnrow"><button class="btn primary" id="cfgClose">Fechar</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Despacho Betim -->
<div class="overlay" id="dispOverlay">
  <div class="cfgbox" style="width:min(1040px,96vw)">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <h3 style="margin:0">Despacho —</h3>
      <select id="dispBaseSel" style="background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 11px;font-size:15px"></select>
    </div>
    <p id="dispResumo">—</p>
    <div id="dispConflito" style="display:none;margin:0 0 14px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;
         background:rgba(241,85,106,.14);border:1px solid var(--red);color:#ffd0d6;font-size:13px;font-weight:600"></div>
    <table id="dispTable"><tbody></tbody></table>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:12px">A troca pode ser feita a partir de ~60 Bar. As mais distantes são adiantadas porque ocupam o caminhão por mais tempo e têm menos folga. Tempos de viagem são editáveis na engrenagem (⚙).</p>
    <div class="btnrow"><button class="btn primary" id="dispClose">Fechar</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Exportar relatório -->
<div class="overlay" id="exportOverlay">
  <div class="cfgbox" style="width:min(620px,94vw)">
    <h3>Exportar relatório</h3>
    <p>Escolha o período e os arquivos. Gera CSV e/ou uma planilha Excel (.xlsx) no formato pivô — uma linha por horário, uma coluna por empresa — para o operador ver sem abrir a pasta de dados.</p>
    <div class="cfgrow">
      <label>De<input type="date" id="expDe"></label>
      <label>Até<input type="date" id="expAte"></label>
      <button class="btn" id="expTudo" type="button">Todo o histórico</button>
    </div>
    <div style="margin:6px 0 6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px">Indicadores (no resumo por empresa)</div>
    <div class="cfgrow" id="expIndic" style="gap:10px 18px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <label style="flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:0"><input type="checkbox" data-ind="leituras" checked> Nº de leituras</label>
      <label style="flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:0"><input type="checkbox" data-ind="ultima" checked> Última e menor pressão</label>
      <label style="flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:0"><input type="checkbox" data-ind="consumo" checked> Consumo médio e pico</label>
      <label style="flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:0"><input type="checkbox" data-ind="abast" checked> Nº de abastecimentos</label>
      <label style="flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:0"><input type="checkbox" data-ind="abastAlta" checked> Abastec. com pressão alta</label>
